			<div class="content" id="post-content-4070552">
									

<p>I understand. The reason that they did it is because they <em>did</em> it, from a weird time travel standpoint. It's a bootstrap paradox yes, and I'd like to think that the SCP Foundation does a lot of weird stuff in order to stop time paradoxes like that. Time travel stuff can get complicated however, and I understand if I didn't write it well enough to get away with it.</p>
<p>I might try to fix up some of the numbers that make more sense for the, maybe calculate some stuff to see some more exact numbers. also, I like to think that they use time travel to cut down on the time it takes to do it. I may add more versions present, because now that I think about it, it does seem like a pretty small number. Anyway, thanks for the read!</p>

